# Keep every text file LF in this repository.
#
# Why: this folder is meant to be copied/lifted into its own public GitHub
# repository. On Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) a shell script with
# CRLF line endings fails in GitHub Actions with "\r: command not found",
# which would make scripts/check-links.sh look broken for no reason.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
